   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi Paul,</div><div><br></div>Is it possible to fit in brms a model of the form<div><br></div><div>gam( y ~ fac + s(x, by=fac) )</div><div><br></div><div>where x is a continuous variable and fac is a factor, as in the mgcv package ?</div><div><br></div><div>I understand that the &#39;by&#39; syntax does not work in brms, but maybe there is another way of doing the same thing. I have tried fac*s(x), but it also produces an error. </div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>:)</div><div>pawel</div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
